From d03c70c07e7c6539f51828ff2fed27003a605dd9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Boris Brezillon <boris.brezillon@collabora.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Apr 2026 10:56:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] panfrost: Record access to plane1+ in case of
 multi-planar resources

At the moment we only track accesses to multiplanar resources as accesses
on the first plane. This has implications if the plane is then passed
to some other HW which waits on readiness. In practice it's probably
okay because all planes will be used at the same time, so waiting on
the first plane should be enough, but better safe than sorry.

Signed-off-by: Boris Brezillon <boris.brezillon@collabora.com>
Reviewed-by: Eric Guo <Eric.guo@nxp.com>
---
